[node name="LooksLetter" type="Node3D" unique_id=486376684]
editor_description = "assets/21: one floor letter's Looks (elevator.md, The riders): the round cap, its printed letter and the red ring of a locked floor, at the old ElevatorLetter's size; the origin on the cap's middle, its face +Z. glyph_b shows here; the Elevator shows its stop's glyph. Clips: dark (the plain cap), lit (the car's floor: warm amber, glowing, brown letter), locked (dark grey with the red ring)."

